thor if Felix leaves ~863'. That is only Felix's own share. It doesn't combine this with the share already owned by people who left, and the combined figure is below 70%.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"C names jnagpaul (2023) and Vincent Rischmann (2025-03) as inactive and says Felix is only occasionally around. It doesn't name mochalins as departed, and it lists Dmitri Volkov as an active contributor without crediting printVersion.\", \"pass\": false}]}","ttft_ms":13719,"type":"result","duration_ms":13742,"uuid":"2bff9f99-1c84-4fab-969c-e275499df317","ttft_stream_ms":1831,"time_to_request_ms":420,"first_content_frame_ms":1831,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
